{"Null dereference crash when evt.destinationCalendar is empty or undefined - destructuring results in mainHostDestinationCalendar being undefined, then accessing .integration throws TypeError": 0.8278054594993591, "Organization creation slug logic is inverted - slug is set when billing IS enabled instead of when it's NOT enabled, breaking organization URLs in non-billing deployments": 0.9107120633125305, "Google Calendar createEvent patch call at line 168 uses potentially undefined selectedCalendar without fallback, while insert correctly uses selectedCalendar || 'primary' - causes hangout link update to fail when event is created on primary calendar": 0.8776186108589172, "Google Calendar updateEvent fallback for selectedCalendar always resolves to undefined because the else-branch searches destinationCalendar array using externalCalendarId which is already known to be falsy": 0.9395813941955566, "Google Calendar deleteEvent fallback for calendarId has same bug as updateEvent - when externalCalendarId is falsy, find() uses that falsy value as search criterion and never matches, causing deletion to target wrong calendar": 0.9397289752960205}